{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "580b7723d05486fb6902093b06705e0f6208ca7fc67a749d3f53a084fcbbc177", "ja": "（もうすぐ定期公演の開演時間だが……\n楽屋に育の姿がないな）", "zh": "（定期公演的开演时间就快到了……\n休息室却看不到育的身影。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ed228d12f97b58ce8a88f0fb36f164867c5fb8a09b6d15e8a77b105ae40bbc19", "ja": "（メイクさんが言うには、携帯を持って\n出て行ったとの事だったが……どこに行ったんだ？）", "zh": "（化妆师说她拿着手机跑出去了……\n究竟跑去哪里了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "f74ed36bc9b689b7bf9c53a8acec3c55189b0c3bd6e7480a6e0e6d963076b3a5", "ja": "ぐすっ……おとうさんのウソツキ……。", "zh": "呜呜……爸爸这个大骗子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "abd0a805f874f783f36e4ea3b8029f35ff4f83ee52e0d6f93f864b0388745a68", "ja": "この声は……育？　こっちからか？", "zh": "这个声音是……育？是从这里传来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "10a5485bbd15b5235b2134918c12b1efedfc2350ffacd2f367f9c6b65d7e761c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1005_p", "source_sha256": "669c1a6452ddc12195b4d6236944b0aadc5baf2b653b79428deb7bc2bcb4dbbb", "ja": "育？\n……どうしたんだ、何かあったのか？", "zh": "育？\n……怎么了？发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "66dd410b34f63ad17e7e578718e7544e3d36ceed6b8ac6649c3e68881a6af63d", "ja": "…………あのね。\nおとうさんが、来られなくなっちゃったの。", "zh": "…………就是，\n我爸爸没办法来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "644fa98e86e7d0af4cdf5197e10ab69a78d721d2a93438ce7be804c764843ac4", "ja": "今日の公演、見にきてくれるって約束だったのに。\n急なお仕事が入っちゃったんだって……。", "zh": "他明明答应我要来看今天的公演，\n却说有紧急的工作要处理……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b0214b3db7cad2c6598299008d0c3b4c77ead006558df6c27345cad13710a08e", "ja": "そうか……今日は、\n育のお父さんが来てくれるはずだったのか。", "zh": "这样啊……\n今天你爸爸原本要来看表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "f5a1e7f81694bb1021bcb03fa9701f3ceeb6b0dd9229cf7ac10fab5705e74c6a", "ja": "うん。ずっと前から約束してたんだ。\nわたしのおとうさん、お仕事いそがしいから……。", "zh": "嗯，他很久之前就答应我了。\n我爸爸工作很忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "9e1fb881113b317f390421e6cd590471b2954b26b15b1ef4ca0c6ba6c93f74fb", "ja": "いつも家にいないから、メールで約束したんだよ。\n昨日の夜も、明日がんばるから見にきてねって……。", "zh": "因为他总是不在家，所以我们是用简讯约好的。\n昨天晚上我也跟他说我明天会加油，要他过来看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "1e2401890cee4e7bbb403a9c0c34f1fc5e5a907f26c4d8a9cb17a999f5d6de8d", "ja": "ちゃんと、約束したのに……。", "zh": "我们明明已经约好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f37d60603f62ed78d837b828d3d00754e696256f2f4556884f62fa9aea02519d", "ja": "育……。", "zh": "育……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "e8d93d6f47620a4508e8be2a43b82d1b8a1e2311994da4185c87234a7a6036ef", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n大人は約束を守らないといけないんでしょ？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n大人必须遵守约定，没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "de9893c046acf8a72f2cba2c28ec5b47ecb2c4bf7418b08462a18ec2d67e0fd5", "ja": "おとうさん、いっつも約束やぶるんだよ。\n運動会も、授業参観も……。", "zh": "我爸爸总是毁约，\n不管是运动会，或是教学观摩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "12133abdd512c952f5883915794b3a76efa614268bf06a819657e13736d601d7", "ja": "おとうさんが見にきてくれるって言ったから、\nわたし、いつもよりレッスンがんばったのに……。", "zh": "因为爸爸说要过来看，\n我上训练课程时比平常更加努力的说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1016_p", "source_sha256": "973b7fa9206ba15416bf73cac6eecec0c4febbe35c22a59c209abb7361ec03f6", "ja": "そうか……残念だよな。お父さんも育のアイドル姿を\nみたら、すごく喜んでくれたと思うよ。", "zh": "这样啊……真可惜。\n他要是看见你当偶像的模样，应该会非常开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1017_p", "source_sha256": "640bfcf38dd9ca20e86108cc4ee4d3ccdfb66e8fb2db65355ec8a082293947a7", "ja": "そうだ。育、今回はその頑張った成果を、\nファンの人達に見てもらわないか？", "zh": "对了，育，你这次努力的成果，\n能让那些粉丝看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "60209b88e0b6a6dd4799e1980f8d70e6a9f12127c0097ef0f1e985532c59ebbc", "ja": "え？　ファンのみんなに……？", "zh": "咦？粉丝……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1019_p", "source_sha256": "745415f4c468bedd2432dd8b5075a042bca5c5a633f15308206429af7c3a3e4a", "ja": "ああ。みんな育のステージを楽しみにしてるし、\nきっと喜んでくれるぞ。", "zh": "对啊，大家都很期待你的表演，\n看了一定会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1020_p", "source_sha256": "96899c664ae842f5a566acdbd243503f8f27fed042a30ba88112ccbc448be354", "ja": "それに公演が盛り上がれば、育が\n頑張っていることだって、お父さんにも伝わるよ。", "zh": "而且公演气氛热烈的话，\n爸爸也会感受到育的努力喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "09f300e3f44b2de599b011a5366365c36cafca10fc114803de772ae244201580", "ja": "……ほんとう？\nファンのみんなも、おとうさんも、よろこんでくれる？", "zh": "……真的吗？\n粉丝和爸爸都会很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1022_p", "source_sha256": "07d674c80dec7bc1b982c92fd7ce635d0a1542fc3d89b0b33a36164b20553ddf", "ja": "ああ、本当だ。\nだから育は、今日の公演で大活躍してみせて……。", "zh": "嗯，当然啰。\n所以你要在今天的公演上大放异彩──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3698f9fcfde923dacdc10552be41d7b5b2f98ab8cecdfb842d7e74478df6ed99", "ja": "お父さんが『観たかった』って羨ましがるくらい、\n大成功させてみせよう！", "zh": "带来一场圆满成功的公演，\n棒到连你爸爸都羡慕说『好想去看啊』那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "771820f25a7bd35778a84bd057e528a3226017245d57e458177a5197401b8846", "ja": "おとうさんが、うらやましがるくらい……。", "zh": "成功到让爸爸羡慕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c0c1ce72ed41b52b9ff9949979cb20c8f33a6691323c8ccce7609e6460e57443", "ja": "うん。それにお父さんだって、本当は\n育の公演が見られなくて、残念がってるはずだ。", "zh": "嗯，而且无法看到你的公演，\n我想你爸爸其实也感到很可惜才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1026_p", "source_sha256": "77c1828cadce00542e550b313856574acffa7d9306102fcc9ad20a7dd8649a98", "ja": "だから育が大活躍だったって聞いたら、\nきっと嬉しいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "所以要是听到育表现得很精彩，\n他一定会很开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "c478ae70f1ae1389cd84b21241aa546517967f365ba7abf35b10631164342526", "ja": "……わかった。じゃあ、わたし、\n今日はファンのみんなに見てもらうためにがんばる。", "zh": "……我明白了，\n那我今天会努力表演给粉丝看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "6ea73441299134d8582ef0052f3b872778a92cec0214e80ee519510a788e1223", "ja": "だから、{$P$}さん、\nわたしのこと、そばで応援しててくれる？", "zh": "所以，{$P$}先生，\n你可以在一旁帮我加油吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_1029", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "当然可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f123648626e8a811195b8784f305553c4e19b05d358973581f1776a178c16a0e", "ja": "もちろんだ！\nさあ、そろそろ開演だ。みんな待ってるぞ！", "zh": "当然可以！\n好了，差不多要开演了，大家都在等喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_2001_030iku", "source_sha256": "566c8f6f8a1cfdda8b1a3bd794fd30d143497326184b556be39c3e43a0106ddf", "ja": "うん……わかった。\n{$P$}さん、行ってきます！", "zh": "嗯……好的。\n{$P$}先生，我先过去啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_030iku_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_030iku_005_2002_p", "source_sha256": "90444a1907936d379b8adaa2ae87fc34aeb69768d1ac21960800656493f6fa49", "ja": "（今はまだ、完全に納得できないかもしれないけど……\n育の願いが叶うその日まで、あの背中を支えよう）", "zh": "（也许育现在还无法完全释怀……\n我就待在身后支持她，直到她实现梦想的那一天吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
